CLUSTER FIRE.

1ST TROOP MUST PROCEED 321ø NORTH THROUGH NATO CONTROLLED
REGIONS. ALL GROUND ELEMENTS OCCUPYING INTERVENING AREA OF 
OPERATIONS ARE TO BE NEUTRALIZED.

1ST TROOP'S MAIN OBJECTIVE WILL BE THE LOGISTICS/RESUPPLY BASE 
THE NATO FORCES HAVE ESTABLISHED. 

2ND TROOP IS ORDERED TO PROCEED ON A NORTH AND WEST COURSE HEADING.
YOUR PRIMARY MISSION WILL BE TO PROVIDE A RESERVE FIRE BASE FOR
1ST TROOP. SHOULD 1ST TROOP FAIL IN THE COMPLETION OF ITS MISSION, 
2ND TROOP IS AUTHORIZED TO TERMINATE ALL OUTSTANDING OBJECTIVES.

